 "words_heard": 196,
 "words": 202,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Jonah walked through Nineveh, three days wide and tall",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He shouted forty days and then your city's going to fall",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.48,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The king came down from his throne and sat down in the dust",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 3.81,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the whole great city turned around, they put away their lust",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 3.21,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When God saw what they did, how they turned from their evil way",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 2.56,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He relented concerning the disaster and he spared them on that day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 2.54,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But Jonah sat outside the town and sulked beneath a vine",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He said I knew you'd be like this, you're merciful and kind",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Should I not then care about Nineveh, that great city",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "More than a hundred and twenty thousand people",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who do not know their right hand from their left",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And also many animals",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The little plant that gave him shade, it withered in a night",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 12.13,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jonah cried about the plant and said it isn't right",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You cared about this plant, which you did not labor for",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I care for every soul, said God, and so much more",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Should I not then care about Nineveh, that great city",
   "heard": 10,
